# Overlay that turns the non-door primitive on, for builds whose only job is to
# prove it still compiles. CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_PRESENCE is default n and nothing in the
# tree sets it, so the ordinary build -- and therefore CI and verify_port --
# never compiled a line of presence code. CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_PIV_CCID sat broken behind
# exactly that gap until a bench run happened to hit it.
#
# Layered ON TOP of sdkconfig.defaults, never instead of it:
#   idf.py -B build-presence -DSDKCONFIG=build-presence/sdkconfig \
#          -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.presence" build
CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_PRESENCE=y
